# Blog app (`@pakfactory/blog`)

Follow [`apps/blog/CLAUDE.md`](../../CLAUDE.md), [`AGENTS.md`](../../../../AGENTS.md), [`DESIGN.md`](../../../../DESIGN.md) (UI), [`docs/blog-3-jira-conventions.md`](../../../../docs/blog-3-jira-conventions.md).

**Quick rules:**

- **URLs:** `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL` = origin only; public paths via `absoluteUrl()` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_BLOG_BASE_PATH` (may be `/blog` in production). Do not concatenate `getSiteUrl()` with raw paths.
- **Robots (PROD-1495):** posts always index; unfiltered listings (including page ≥2) → **index, follow**; filters / odd `perPage` → **noindex, follow** (`getListingRobotsFromSearchParams`).
- **Sanity:** queries from `@pakfactory/sanity/queries` only; agents never write documents/seeds.
- **AEO/GEO:** `generateMetadata` + JSON-LD via `@pakfactory/seo` only.
- **Components:** ADR-008/011/013 under `src/components/{blocks,layout,views,modules,ui,post}/`; ADR-007 inline single-route views.
- **UI:** tokens + primitives per DESIGN.md; dieline gutters per blog CLAUDE; prefer `Card` / `Button` / `Badge` / `Input`.

**Skills:** seo-content-writer, on-page-seo-auditor, geo-content-optimizer, seo-structured-data (root `CLAUDE.md`).

**Ops:** [`memory.md`](../../memory.md) — ops only, not policy canon.
